; Bushes block an NPC's sight (scripts\ai_tuning.script, https://app.notion.com/p/40ed89dbf39d815ea34bd623b9aa298c). vis_transparency_factor: how much of the
; sight a ray keeps through one face of the material; an NPC sees a target when the product along the ray stays above
; its transparency_threshold (m_stalker.ltx: 0.73 calm, 0.6 in a fight). The same test decides whether it may shoot.
; Vanilla gamemtl.xr: bush 0.70 (seen through in a fight), bush_sux 0.35.
[materials\bush]
vis_transparency_factor = 0.4

[materials\bush_sux]
vis_transparency_factor = 0.2
